nt-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><a href=\"http://ps.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ps.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452464854000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MFpFZ7rjSexPa9o8ykPVm\">ps.com</a>\r\n [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>Im Auftrag von </b>Tomas Telensky<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Dienstag, 31. Mai 2016 09:38<br>\r\n<b>An:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unma...@googlegroups.com</a><br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> [unmarked] pcount: R or M sites?</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hello,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">noticed this in help page of unmarkedFramePCount:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">y       An RxJ matrix of the repeated count data, where R is the number of sites...<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">siteCovs        A data.frame .... This should have M rows ...<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">So y has R rows for each site and siteCovs has M rows for each site.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">So:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">1) Is it a mistake and R = M?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Or,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">2) Is it allowed to supply different amount of sites in siteCovs? For what?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">For prediction?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks!<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">        Tomas<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#888888\"> <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#888888\">--\r\n<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792452464854000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06ny9gv-e1xEV2LZ5mOrVv\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><span style=\"color:#888888\">-- </span></span><span style=\"color:#888888\"><br>\r\n<span>You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;unmarked&quot; group.</span><br>\r\n<span>To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">unmarked+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.</span><br>\r\n<span>For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/op